{
  "name": "V-PLUGIN-PING-REMOTE",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Ping inside a Remote Execution body on the real sshd host: it reaches a service only the remote host can resolve, pings the remote loopback, records a silent host, and the same Host pinged from WAVE does not resolve.",
